Major todo item(s)
==================

Support for independent channels/namespaces/etc
-----------------------------------------------

Version 0 messages calculate PoW as
"sha256 of timestamp+nonce+checksum" and mix all
messages together even if servers have different
PoW targets. Add 4th item to PoW calculation of
version 1 messages with fixed length of 16 bytes
representing channel name, for example.

Channels could also be treated as a hierarchy
where server memory limit(s) can be defined
separately for individual channels as well as
particular groups of them, based on their name
for example:
news         - 1.0 MB
news:europe  - 0.1 MB
news:america - 0.1 MB
...


Remove support for diffrent PoW targets?
----------------------------------------

Version 0 messages define PoW as "|T - H| * S * A",
where PoW target T allows some separation between
messages/servers. Custom target probably not
necessary, especially with channels. Default target
could be set to ffff... with larger sha256 = better.


